\cf1\fs28\b The files are installed\b0\fs22\cf0\par
\par
Student Management System v1.18.75 is on this computer. What comes next depends on the edition.\par
\par
\b Docker Production Edition\b0\par
\bullet  On the next page the wizard builds the application's Docker image, in a console window. The first time this takes 5-10 minutes, and Docker Desktop has to be running.\par
\bullet  The wizard does not start the application. Start it with the Student Management System shortcut: choose 1, START. It opens at http://localhost:8080\par
\bullet  First sign-in with a new local database: the administrator's e-mail address and password are DEFAULT_ADMIN_EMAIL and DEFAULT_ADMIN_PASSWORD in the file config\\.env of the installation folder. The application asks for a new password at once.\par
\bullet  With the shared QNAP database you sign in with your existing account there.\par
\par
\b Native Lite Edition\b0\par
\bullet  Start SMS Lite with the Student Management System shortcut. It opens in your browser.\par
\bullet  New local database: sign in with the administrator account you entered in this wizard.\par
\bullet  Shared QNAP database, or a local database that was already on this PC: sign in with your existing account.\par
\par
Click Next to continue.\par
